.env
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
data/raw/
*.egg-info/
# data/chroma/ is intentionally committed - Gemini's free-tier embed_content
# quota (1000 requests/day, counted per embedded text) can't re-embed this
# corpus from scratch in one day, so ingest is NOT re-run at deploy time.
# Regenerate locally with `dsg_compliance.cli ingest --max-chunks N` (spread
# across multiple days if re-ingesting the full corpus) and recommit.
